      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "The span explicitly states this limit and calls for corroborating evidence."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C049.signal_basis",
    "value": "Separated trajectory concentrations reveal differences in milestone position, waiting time, returns and publication timing. These observations remain causally ambiguous because different or overlapping causes can produce the same timing, and absent events cannot distinguish abandonment from offline preparation.",
    "scope": "Retention behavior observed in the prospective onboarding cohort, considered without corroborating evidence.",
